		"description": "<p>Flexing your left hand and balling it into a fist as you speak a word of power, you conjure a large translucent gauntlet that grasps and squeezes the target of your ire. A creature, which must be your size category or smaller, of your choosing within 30ft of you must make a Strength saving throw or be [[/condition id=grappled]] by this hand of force. While you maintain this stance, you may use your bonus action to maintain a grapple or attempt to grapple a new target within 30ft. When you initiate or maintain a grapple, the target takes Basic Melee force damage. A target that becomes grappled while in the air remains in their current square, even though their flight speed becomes 0.</p>",
