			"description": "<ul><li><p>A grappled creature's Speed becomes 0, and it can't benefit from bonuses to movement speeds.</p></li><li><p>If the grappler becomes incapacitated the condition ends.</p></li><li><p>If an effect removes the grappled creature from the reach of the grappler or grappling effect (such as when a creature is shoved away by the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-maneuvers.Item.i5m1k81burf6n2t9]{Doubleteam} combat maneuver) the condition ends.</p></li></ul>",
